+---
+title: Follow PrompTugal.news
+summary: Follow PrompTugal.news in a feed reader: all articles, one town, or one topic. No account and no email.
+---
+Follow PrompTugal.news in any feed reader (Feedly, NetNewsWire, Inoreader and the rest): copy a feed address into it. There is no account and no sign-up. Each feed lists up to 50 items, newest first; each item carries its own licence and where it came from.
+
+## All our articles {#all}
+
+- [Every article, as an RSS feed](../feed.xml).
+
+## One town or region {#places}
+
+Each place has its own feed: its articles and the local stories its agent found, with a link to the publisher's own page.
+
+<!-- follow:places -->
+
